005400     05  MSG-TEXT.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1        PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER                  PIC X(67).
005500     05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
005600     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
005700
006100 01  FIELD-NUMBER         PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 1.
006200
