011900 COPY DLEVEL     IN COPYLIB.
012000 01  BUF-PER-PERSONNEL.            COPY MPERSONL IN COPYLIB.
012100 COPY MLEVEL     IN COPYLIB.
012200 COPY MPATH      IN COPYLIB.
